@startuml Admin_Chatbot_Management_SSD

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UI: Chatbot Management" as UI
participant "Database" as DB

== View Chatbot Knowledge Base ==

Admin -> UI: Access chatbot management
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch active entries
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return active entries
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch archived entries
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return archived entries
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch tags
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return tags list
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Display entries and tags (Active/Archived tabs)
deactivate UI

== Add Chatbot Entry ==

Admin -> UI: Enter entry details\n(English info, Filipino info, keywords, tags)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Validate input (English required)

alt Input valid
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin -> UI: Confirm add
    
    UI -> DB: Save entry record
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Entry created
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
else Input invalid
    UI --> Admin: Show validation errors
end

deactivate UI

== Edit Chatbot Entry ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Edit" on entry
activate UI

UI -> UI: Populate form with current data

UI --> Admin: Display filled form

Admin -> UI: Modify details and submit

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm update

UI -> DB: Update entry record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Entry updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
deactivate UI

== Manage Tags ==

Admin -> UI: Enter tag name
activate UI

UI -> UI: Validate input

alt Creating/Updating tag
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin -> UI: Confirm
    
    UI -> DB: Save/Update tag
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Tag saved
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh tags
else Deleting tag
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin -> UI: Confirm delete
    
    UI -> DB: Delete tag
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Tag deleted
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh tags
end

deactivate UI

== Archive Entry ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Archive"
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm archive

UI -> DB: Update entry (archived: true)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Entry archived
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Restore Entry ==

Admin -> UI: Switch to Archived tab
activate UI

Admin -> UI: Click "Restore"
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm restore

UI -> DB: Update entry (archived: false)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Entry restored
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Delete Entry ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Delete" on archived entry
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show warning dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm delete

UI -> DB: Remove entry record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Entry deleted
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh archived list
deactivate UI

@enduml
